WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.205
Can DNA polymerase start a new strand

00:00:02.251 --> 00:00:02.936
from scratch?

00:00:03.656 --> 00:00:04.481
Let's test it.

00:00:05.107 --> 00:00:06.152
Here's a bare template.

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:08.010
No new strand yet.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.052
DNA polymerase shows up, ready to build.

00:00:11.679 --> 00:00:13.594
But there's no 3-prime end to add

00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:13.966
to.

00:00:14.686 --> 00:00:15.475
It's stuck.

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.344
Like a zipper with nothing to start

00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:17.600
it.

00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:20.688
DNA polymerase can't start a new strand

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:21.326
from nothing.

00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:22.499
So who starts it?

00:00:23.126 --> 00:00:23.741
Swipe.
